<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct aluminium imports up 15.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct aluminium imports up 15.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined aluminium imports in October totalled 255,219 tonnes, up 15.7 percent from 220,680 tonnes in the same month last year, Finance Ministry statistics released on Thursday showed.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown (on a customs-cleared basis, in tonnes):</p>
<p>		  Oct 96	    Sept 96     Oct 95</p>
<p> Total	  255,219	   249,208     220,680</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Brazil	  25,617	    54,148	23,467</p>
<p> Russia	  56,103	    42,765	32,342</p>
<p> Australia     35,340	    32,561	33,004</p>
<p> U.S.	    22,585	    14,357	27,015</p>
<p>Refined aluminium imports in the first 10 months of 1996 were 2,317,401 tonnes, against 2,376,154 tonnes in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities desk (81-3 3432 7391)</p>
</text>
